WEBVTT

00:00:01.796 --> 00:00:06.217
<v Caller>I saw your contract network administrator opening. Are you still hiring for it?

00:00:06.406 --> 00:00:09.153
<v Hiring manager>Yes. We need someone who can run the cutover.

00:00:09.433 --> 00:00:12.502
<v Caller>What would they need to handle on their own in the first week?

00:00:12.755 --> 00:00:15.285
<v Hiring manager>The switch to the new network on Saturday night.

00:00:15.503 --> 00:00:18.199
<v Caller>Can you bring in an outside recruiter for this role?

00:00:18.463 --> 00:00:23.081
<v Hiring manager>No. Only approved agencies can submit, and the list is closed.

00:00:23.313 --> 00:00:26.170
<v Caller>Got it. I’ll leave it there. Thanks for your time.

00:00:26.471 --> 00:00:27.434
<v Hiring manager>Thanks for checking.
